\href{https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.15454}{arXiv:2411.15454}, version~1, November~23, 2024.
The relevant statements are Theorem~2 and Conjecture~1 on page~9, and Theorem~4 and Conjecture~2 on page~10 of the PDF.
\end{thebibliography}
